{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32384","headline":"原隰荑绿柳 · 温庭筠","name":"原隰荑绿柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逈野韶光早，晴川柳满堤。\n拂尘生嫩绿，披雪见柔荑。\n碧玉牙犹短，黄金缕未齐。\n腰肢弄寒吹，眉意入春闺。\n预恐狂夫折，迎牵逸客迷。\n新莺将出谷，应借一枝栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}